            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article studies the self-assessed pre/postoperative course of the psychological condition of 3 patient groups (hernia, aorto-coronary bypass and cancer patients) and healthy controls. Some consequences for clinical work are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
